      "title": "Upstream request has no timeout",
      "description": "fetchStatus calls http.Get, which uses the default client. The default client has no timeout. A slow upstream holds each /upstream request and its goroutine open indefinitely. Use an http.Client with a Timeout, or a request bound to the incoming request context.",
